sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Frontend
    participant Handler as auth_handler
    participant Service as auth_service
    participant TFService as two_factor_service
    participant Repo as two_factor_repo
    participant DB

    Note over User,DB: ═══ Phase 5: Login with 2FA Flow ═══

    User->>Frontend: 输入 email + password
    Frontend->>Handler: POST /api/auth/login
    Handler->>Service: login(email, password)
    Service->>DB: SELECT * FROM users WHERE email=$1
    Service->>Service: verify_password()
    
    alt user has 2FA enabled
        Service->>Service: generate temp_token (5min TTL, two_factor_pending=true)
        Service-->>Handler: TokenResponse { requires_2fa: true, temp_token }
        Handler-->>Frontend: JSON { requires_2fa: true, temp_token }
        Frontend->>User: 跳转到 2FA 验证页面 (TwoFactorForm)
        
        User->>Frontend: 输入 TOTP code 或恢复码
        Frontend->>Handler: POST /api/auth/2fa/verify { temp_token, code, recovery_code? }
        Handler->>Service: verify_2fa_login(temp_token, code, recovery_code)
        Service->>Service: validate temp_token (decode JWT, check two_factor_pending claim)
        Service->>DB: SELECT totp_secret, recovery_codes, two_factor_enabled FROM users WHERE id=$1
        
        alt using TOTP code
            Service->>TFService: decrypt_secret(encrypted_secret, key)
            Service->>TFService: verify_totp(secret, code)
        else using recovery code
            Service->>TFService: verify_recovery_code(hashed_codes, input_code)
            Service->>DB: UPDATE recovery_codes SET used=true for matched code
        end
        
        Service->>Service: generate real access_token + refresh_token
        Service->>DB: INSERT refresh_tokens
        Service->>DB: write audit log (auth.2fa_verified)
        Service-->>Handler: TokenResponse { access_token, refresh_token }
        Handler-->>Frontend: JSON tokens
        Frontend->>Frontend: 孏tokens to localStorage
        Frontend->>Frontend: fetch user profile
        Frontend->>User: redirect to dashboard
    else no 2FA
        Service->>Service: generate tokens normally
        Service-->>Handler: TokenResponse { requires_2fa: false, access_token, refresh_token }
        Handler-->>Frontend: JSON tokens
        Frontend->>User: redirect to dashboard
    end

    Note over User,DB: ═══ 2FA Setup Flow ═══

    User->>Frontend: 点击"启用 2FA" (Profile page)
    Frontend->>Handler: POST /api/auth/2fa/setup
    Handler->>TFService: setup_2fa(pool, user_id, email)
    TFService->>TFService: generate_secret()
    TFService->>TFService: encrypt_secret(secret, totp_key)
    TFService->>Repo: save_totp_secret(user_id, encrypted_secret)
    Repo->>DB: UPDATE users SET totp_secret=$2 WHERE id=$1
    TFService->>TFService: generate_qr_base64(email, secret)
    TFService->>TFService: generate_recovery_codes() → 10 codes
    TFService->>TFService: hash_recovery_codes(codes) → Argon2 hashes
    TFService->>Repo: save_recovery_codes(user_id, hashed_codes)
    Repo->>DB: UPDATE users SET recovery_codes=$2
    TFService-->>Handler: Setup2FaResponse { qr_base64, secret, recovery_codes }
    Handler-->>Frontend: JSON response
    Frontend->>User: 展示 QR 码 + 恢复码 (TwoFactorSetupDialog)

    User->>Frontend: 扫码后输入 TOTP 验证码确认
    Frontend->>Handler: POST /api/auth/2fa/enable { code }
    Handler->>TFService: enable_2fa(pool, user_id, code)
    TFService->>Repo: get_totp_secret(user_id)
    Repo->>DB: SELECT totp_secret FROM users
    TFService->>TFService: decrypt_secret → verify_totp(secret, code)
    TFService->>Repo: set_2fa_enabled(user_id, true)
    Repo->>DB: UPDATE users SET two_factor_enabled=true
    TFService-->>Handler: ok
    Handler-->>Frontend: 200 OK
